## Backlog

- Ticket merging: when customer sends new ticket about same subject as recent one (especially exchanges), merge into original instead of creating new. Integrates with existing dedup logic. Preferred approach: close new ticket, reopen old (preserves exchange history and prior drafts). See ticket #377 as example.
- Remove legacy walkTree/prescribe functions from sizingEngine.js (requires migrating test assertions)
